# Frontend Admin (React)

- Admin purpose: fraud **REVIEW** queue — vault vs public side-by-side; not a chat-first product UI.
- Functional components; colocate hooks; keep components focused (<150 lines when practical).
- Call authenticated admin APIs only; never request vault URLs from unprivileged roles.
- Prefer existing UI patterns from `Examples/*/ui` only for shell/auth — rewrite domain screens for VERIFIND.
- Compact test output when running frontend tests.
